# The bases (owners, counts, buildings), the map builder and its scenery / shape tables, the main menu, load / save,
# redefine keys. `@inline $C40C`: PrintKeyPrompt ends with JP PrintInline, so the key names
# after each CALL $C40C are text, not code (the t entries $C382-$C3EE below).

# --- the rest of $B7F4: one enemy slot a game turn
$B800 ; HL = slot * 16 (A = slot * 8)
$B803 ; the enemy's records begin at slot 24, $DB80
$B80A ; ActingSide = 1: the target searches ($B3D5, $B36C) look from the enemy's side
