$B816 ; a free slot: try to build a robot, four tries over the four warbases
$B818 ; the owner byte (+3) of warbase 0 in the bases table $FD70
$B81B SpawnPickBase ; each warbase in turn is taken with chance 1/2
$B822 ; and only if its +3 is $20 exactly: the enemy's, not destroyed
