$B82E ; no warbase taken: no robot this turn
$B82F SpawnAtBase ; B = the warbase's y, HL = its x: the door cell the robot appears on
$B837 ; x to HL' and y to B' for the placing at $B8D9
$B83C ; HL = the door's map cell
$B83F ; the door and the three cells in front of it (row y+1, x-1 to x+1) must hold no robot or building (bit 6)
$B84C ; blocked: wait for another turn
$B84D ; the parts: a random mask (the second of two draws)
$B857 ; the chassis bits 0-2: exactly one of bipod, tracks, anti-grav
$B863 ; none or two chassis: no robot
