> PrintInline bytes: attribute $57, position (0,22), size 0, "ДЕНЬ:", newline, " ЧАС:", position (22,0), size $21 (2 rows high, 1 byte wide), attribute $45, "РАДАР:", 0. Bright white on red for the clock labels, bright cyan on black for РАДАР:. PrintInline returns past the 0 into ShowStatusPanel: DrawPlayScreen has no RET of its own.
$D1E5 c ShowStatusPanel ; Clear the right panel and print the status labels
> ClearPanel, then StatusPanelText. Called when the robot menu ends (CloseRobotMenu $A819) and at the game's end (GameStop $AF07). DrawPlayScreen falls into it after its own string, so every play screen gets the labels. The numbers come from UpdateStatusPanel.
